<head>
<no>9</no><heading guid="_3d51c555-eb90-42f3-b764-90da4333669c"
id="sec.9-he"><b>Investigation of accounts by
Auditor-General</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Auditor-General, whenever he or she thinks it
desirable so to do, may investigate the accounts of any Voluntary
Workers&#8217; Association, and shall report the result of the investigation
to the Minister for Lands, who shall take such action as the Minister may deem
desirable to safeguard the interests of such Voluntary Workers&#8217;
Association or the persons whom it is the object of the Voluntary
Workers&#8217; Association to benefit.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.10">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5bbcf541-3d8b-49e0-96e3-f5be24289e5f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>10</no><heading guid="_3dc11ce4-45d9-4680-9061-6b449cefa7eb"
id="sec.10-he"><b>Regulations</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3e8d2dd1-9854-440a-b202-3b4a03f3f3d4"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may make regulations for carrying
out the provisions of this Act and in particular:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_50f442b1-d233-4ab5-99ab-b23af2bc9ee4" id="sec.10-ssec.1-para1">
<block><txt break.before="1">prescribing the conditions on which moneys may be
paid by the Public Trustee to Voluntary Workers&#8217;
Associations,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c974b020-b8eb-43a3-81e6-959e96a54e8c" id="sec.10-ssec.1-para1-oc.2">
<block><txt break.before="1">prescribing the particulars to be furnished to
the Public Trustee by such associations as to the expenditure of the moneys so
paid to them,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_29d710c8-320e-47e0-8f4c-6dad33b0d6e1" id="sec.10-ssec.1-para1-oc.3">
<block><txt break.before="1">prescribing the terms and conditions of mortgages
by members of the forces and dependents,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c50a23c9-1a1b-433a-9228-050012ba06b8" id="sec.10-ssec.1-para1-oc.4">
<block><txt break.before="1">fixing the rate of interest to be charged in such
mortgages,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a6a1edbf-e398-439d-9944-d862db6a5ccf" id="sec.10-ssec.1-para1-oc.5">
<block><txt break.before="1">prescribing the particulars to be furnished to
the Public Trustee as to the materials provided for or used in respect of any
portion.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


