<head>
<no>11</no><heading guid="_6a8607f9-46b4-4121-b089-0f889b210f09"
id="sec.11-he"><b>Minister may grant and convey land</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Notwithstanding anything to the contrary in the
<legref jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Education and Public Instruction Act
1987</i></name></legref>, the Minister of Public Instruction may without
consideration grant and convey the lands described in the Schedule hereto to
trustees for homes for disabled members of the forces and dependents, subject
to such conditions and with such powers with regard to the land as the
Governor may confer on them:</txt>

