<head>
<no>12</no><heading guid="_04fe0b33-d424-4cf7-8278-903d77443565"
id="sec.12-he"><b>Repeal of Act does not affect operation of certain
provisions</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.12-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_fd104c81-187a-4784-b3bc-ae296a53c7f8"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.12-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Despite the repeal of the <legref jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Voluntary Workers
(Soldiers&#8217; Holdings) Amendment Act 1974</i></name></legref>, sections
4&#8211;8 of that Act continue to have effect and are taken to have been
transferred to this Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.12-ssec.2">
