<attrib name="id" value="sec.12-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Sections 4&#8211;8 of the <legref jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Voluntary Workers
(Soldiers&#8217; Holdings) Amendment Act 1974</i></name></legref> are
transferred provisions to which section 30A of the <legref jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown" refid="act-1987-015"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Interpretation Act 1987</i></name></legref>
applies.</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 12:</b> Ins 2007 No 82,
Sch 4.26.</txt></content>
